              <strong>Figure 4.2:</strong> Interactive Data Forwarding (Bypassing) Workbench. When forwarding is enabled, dedicated multiplexer buses route calculated results directly from EX/MEM or MEM/WB to ALU inputs, resolving RAW hazards in 0 stall cycles. For Load-Use hazards, the Hazard Detection Unit inserts a single bubble stall.
