                  3. Monolithic Multi-Lane RVV (Ara) &bull; 4. Clustered VRF (AraXL)<br />
                  5. DAE Streaming (Snitch SSR) &bull; 6. 2D Systolic Mesh (Gemmini)<br />
                  7. Vector-Matrix Tile Tensor &bull; 8. Multi-Warp SIMT GPGPU (Vortex)
