                <td style="padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;">
                  1. Microcontroller Bus SoCs (PULPissimo, IOb-SoC)<br />
                  2. Shared-L1 Compute Clusters (PULP / Snitch Cluster)<br />
                  3. Linux Application Host SoCs (Cheshire, Carfield)<br />
                  4. Directory-Coherent Tiled 2D Mesh Manycores (OpenPiton, Astral)<br />
                  5. Ultra-Scale Flat Scratchpad &amp; Chiplet Manycores (MemPool, Occamy)
                </td>
