          <div class="analogy-icon">&#9878;</div>
          <div class="analogy-text">
            <strong>The Takeaway:</strong> Having 4, 4, 8, and 5 archetypes is not a design inconsistency—it is <strong>proof of scientific rigor</strong>. It demonstrates that SCORE's categorization is derived directly from empirical silicon physics, memory walls, and communication constraints, rather than forced into an artificial, ungrounded template.
